const POL=()=>T('Custom items are made/sourced to order. After your deposit is paid we email you an order summary (vehicle, VIN, options, lead time) with a Confirm production start link; we do not order parts or start production until you confirm. Cancel before you confirm production start: full refund. Cancel after production/purchasing has started: we refund your deposit minus the actual costs already incurred for your order (materials, machining, freight), with an itemized cost breakdown; the deduction never exceeds your deposit. Once shipped: no returns, refunds or exchanges. Exception: if your item arrives damaged, wrong or missing parts, email support@oliandcece.com with photos within 7 days of delivery; we send a replacement first, or refund you if a replacement is not possible. Approved refunds go back to the original payment method in 5–10 business days.','定制商品均为按单生产/采购。付定金后我们会发邮件给你核对订单（车型、VIN、选配、工期）并点击「确认开工」，确认前不会采购或生产。确认开工前取消：全额退款。开工/采购后取消：退还定金减去已实际发生的成本（材料、加工、运费），附成本明细，扣除额以定金为上限。一旦发货，不退不换。例外：如收到的商品损坏、发错或缺件，请在签收后 7 天内将照片发至 support@oliandcece.com，我们优先补发，无法补发则退款。退款原路退回，5–10 个工作日到账。');
const POLF=()=>T('PAY-IN-FULL refund policy (custom / made-to-order items): after payment we email you an order summary with a Confirm production start link; nothing is ordered or produced until you confirm. Cancel before you confirm: full refund. Cancel after production/purchasing has started: we refund the amount paid minus the actual costs already incurred (materials, machining, freight), with an itemized cost breakdown; the deduction never exceeds the deposit amount for that item. Once shipped: no returns, refunds or exchanges. Exception: if your item arrives damaged, wrong or missing parts, email support@oliandcece.com with photos within 7 days of delivery; we send a replacement first, or refund you if a replacement is not possible. Approved refunds go back to the original payment method in 5–10 business days.','全款支付退款政策（定制/按单生产商品）：付款后我们会发邮件给你核对订单并点击「确认开工」，确认前不会采购或生产。确认开工前取消：全额退款。开工/采购后取消：退还已付金额减去已实际发生的成本（材料、加工、运费），附成本明细，扣除额不超过该商品的定金金额。一旦发货，不退不换。例外：如收到的商品损坏、发错或缺件，请在签收后 7 天内将照片发至 support@oliandcece.com，我们优先补发，无法补发则退款。退款原路退回，5–10 个工作日到账。');
const POLD=()=>T('IN-STOCK ITEM refund policy (paid in full, ships direct from our supplier): cancel any time before shipment for a full refund. Once shipped: no returns, refunds or exchanges. Exception: if your item arrives damaged, wrong or missing parts, email support@oliandcece.com with photos within 7 days of delivery; we send a replacement first, or refund you if a replacement is not possible. Approved refunds go back to the original payment method in 5–10 business days.','现货商品退款政策（全款支付，供应商直发）：发货前随时取消可全额退款。一旦发货，不退不换。例外：如收到的商品损坏、发错或缺件，请在签收后 7 天内将照片发至 support@oliandcece.com，我们优先补发，无法补发则退款。退款原路退回，5–10 个工作日到账。');
const PBUL=()=>T(['Full refund if you cancel before you confirm production start.','After production/purchasing starts: refund minus actual costs incurred (itemized), deduction capped at your deposit.','Once shipped: no returns, refunds or exchanges.','Damaged, wrong or missing parts: email photos to support@oliandcece.com within 7 days of delivery — replacement first, refund if not possible.'],['确认开工前取消：全额退款。','开工/采购后取消：退还金额减去已实际发生的成本（附明细），扣除额以定金为上限。','一旦发货，不退不换。','损坏、发错或缺件：签收后 7 天内将照片发至 support@oliandcece.com——优先补发，无法补发则退款。']);
